(1189632, 149268, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sensational lighting and a georgeous model.<br/> <br/>The heater (?) works well as it looks old, so could be from the 70''s.  However, I would love this shot lighting wise but without the heater (i.e. heater is perfect for the challenge and thus you got a 10 anyway, but as a non challenge photo I would like it more without the heater).  Sensational shot.</td>', 'Sensational lighting and a georgeous model. The heater (?) works well as it looks old, so could be from the 70''s.  However, I would love this shot lighting wise but without the heater (i.e. heater is perfect for the challenge and thus you got a 10 anyway, but as a non challenge photo I would like it more without the heater).  Sensational shot.', '2005-02-23 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1189637, 148139, 33749, '<td valign="top">This ol'' hippie doesn''t feel very 70''s to me.<br/> <br/>Without the title, it''s just a photo of someone who was alive in the 70''s,  and theme aside, the photo is a little uninteresting.</td>', 'This ol'' hippie doesn''t feel very 70''s to me. Without the title, it''s just a photo of someone who was alive in the 70''s,  and theme aside, the photo is a little uninteresting.', '2005-02-23 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
