(1190708, 149230, 33736, '<td valign="top">Yep. Been there; seen this; didn''t like it then.  But, it''s a darned cute pic now!  How did you get your model to quit laughing?!  The position of the hands and body are just right.</td>', 'Yep. Been there; seen this; didn''t like it then.  But, it''s a darned cute pic now!  How did you get your model to quit laughing?!  The position of the hands and body are just right.', '2005-02-23 12:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
