(1190711, 149492, 32345, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and idea, but the Rubik''s cube mania was in the early 80''s</td>', 'Nice picture and idea, but the Rubik''s cube mania was in the early 80''s', '2005-02-23 12:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
