(1190738, 149466, 30841, '<td valign="top">would have been a great submission for this week''s challenge :) a little too much white, which turns yellow towards the bottom right half. Maybe a bit more contrast to bring out the pink. 6</td>', 'would have been a great submission for this week''s challenge :) a little too much white, which turns yellow towards the bottom right half. Maybe a bit more contrast to bring out the pink. 6', '2005-02-23 12:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
