(1190743, 149503, 31213, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Really great job.  Looks like a scene from a movie!  Very sharp cinematic eye you have. Good luck!<br/> <br/>Bump to a 10 and added to favorites.  Great job!</td>', 'Wow!  Really great job.  Looks like a scene from a movie!  Very sharp cinematic eye you have. Good luck! Bump to a 10 and added to favorites.  Great job!', '2005-02-23 12:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
