(1190758, 149564, 30841, '<td valign="top">a little grainy. This shot initially made me think of the ''50''s without looking at the title. additionally I think the placement of the sign could have been a bit better. 6</td>', 'a little grainy. This shot initially made me think of the ''50''s without looking at the title. additionally I think the placement of the sign could have been a bit better. 6', '2005-02-23 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
