(1190792, 149523, 27922, '<td valign="top">I love this picuture. I am rating it the highest. It is clear, I like the girl and the whole scene is just right for this challenge! I would like to see more from this photographer!</td>', 'I love this picuture. I am rating it the highest. It is clear, I like the girl and the whole scene is just right for this challenge! I would like to see more from this photographer!', '2005-02-23 13:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
