(1190798, 148124, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot; having trouble leaving it. The timing and the cropping make this one fascinating.   (having flashbacks of oceans of leftover milk - discovered by Moms everywhere the next morning.)</td>', 'Wonderful shot; having trouble leaving it. The timing and the cropping make this one fascinating.   (having flashbacks of oceans of leftover milk - discovered by Moms everywhere the next morning.)', '2005-02-23 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
