(1191215, 149500, 17033, '<td valign="top">This has winner all over it. Practically the only shot in this challenge with INTEGRITY and it does show in the way that I look at it. What it reminds me of is those rather patronising and forced articles that National Geographic had at that time: for example, this could be ''Work and Play on the West Coast''. The muted colours, the soft focus and the great composition all hit the nail  on the head. In a word: perfect.</td>', 'This has winner all over it. Practically the only shot in this challenge with INTEGRITY and it does show in the way that I look at it. What it reminds me of is those rather patronising and forced articles that National Geographic had at that time: for example, this could be ''Work and Play on the West Coast''. The muted colours, the soft focus and the great composition all hit the nail  on the head. In a word: perfect.', '2005-02-23 15:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
