(1191859, 149209, 29269, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>We had card punchers at school... did not have to cut the holes out.<br/>Meets the challenge:9 <br/>composition: 7 (I would have placed the holes more in focus, and got rid of the chads)<br/>Lighting: 6<br/>total: 7 (bumping up from initial 6)</td>', 'returning for comments:We had card punchers at school... did not have to cut the holes out.Meets the challenge:9 composition: 7 (I would have placed the holes more in focus, and got rid of the chads)Lighting: 6total: 7 (bumping up from initial 6)', '2005-02-23 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1191867, 149553, 29269, '<td valign="top">Similar concept worked twice (that I can remember) - once with US and once with UK flag <br/>[thumb]2892[/thumb] and<br/>[thumb]128336[/thumb]<br/> <br/>I don''t see why it couldn''t work this time. Taking someone else''s (or perhaps your own - I can''t tell now of course) idea and making the best out of it is not so bad. The fact that I have seen something similar to this one and haven''t seen something similar to other people''s does not mean they did not borrow someone else''s concept. I''m trying to say that I am not going to score you down for lack of originality if I like what I see, and I do like what I see.<br/> <br/>bumping up to 8 in the second pass.</td>', 'Similar concept worked twice (that I can remember) - once with US and once with UK flag [thumb]2892[/thumb] and[thumb]128336[/thumb] I don''t see why it couldn''t work this time. Taking someone else''s (or perhaps your own - I can''t tell now of course) idea and making the best out of it is not so bad. The fact that I have seen something similar to this one and haven''t seen something similar to other people''s does not mean they did not borrow someone else''s concept. I''m trying to say that I am not going to score you down for lack of originality if I like what I see, and I do like what I see. bumping up to 8 in the second pass.', '2005-02-23 22:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1191869, 149524, 29269, '<td valign="top">How true for the 2000s as well as for the 1970s. This is very good image, technically speaking. I can see what you wanted to refer to with your title, but it is not exclusively ''70s issue, so that brings the mark down to 6.</td>', 'How true for the 2000s as well as for the 1970s. This is very good image, technically speaking. I can see what you wanted to refer to with your title, but it is not exclusively ''70s issue, so that brings the mark down to 6.', '2005-02-23 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1191870, 148714, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very good. I''m not sure if you could have achieved better focus for the pong though. One of the ribbon candidates IMO. Bumping up to 8.</td>', 'Very good. I''m not sure if you could have achieved better focus for the pong though. One of the ribbon candidates IMO. Bumping up to 8.', '2005-02-23 22:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1191871, 148587, 19978, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately Fischer never played Karpov - theirs was the match that Fischer ducked in ''75. You probably meant Fischer-Spassky ''72. At any rate, a good photo interpretation of that memorable event.</td>', 'Unfortunately Fischer never played Karpov - theirs was the match that Fischer ducked in ''75. You probably meant Fischer-Spassky ''72. At any rate, a good photo interpretation of that memorable event.', '2005-02-23 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1191888, 149524, 33112, '<td valign="top">Great concept...I only wish you had used a more neutral shirt...that one is a little too modern.....but it''s a very powerful image.  8</td>', 'Great concept...I only wish you had used a more neutral shirt...that one is a little too modern.....but it''s a very powerful image.  8', '2005-02-23 22:43:50.000000', NULL, 1);
