(1192021, 149524, 18367, '<td valign="top">Fantastic interpretation.... This really exemplifies tthe two camps that dominated this time period.  I recall the peaceniks,  and other forms of demonstration ...and how vietnam war vets were  percieved and treated upon their return.<br/> <br/>The black and white for me is also reflective of the ideologies of the day.... as most folks on both sides of the issue viewed things in black and white terms only.<br/> <br/>My initial score is an 8, but I will most certainly re-visit the one again.\<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Fantastic interpretation.... This really exemplifies tthe two camps that dominated this time period.  I recall the peaceniks,  and other forms of demonstration ...and how vietnam war vets were  percieved and treated upon their return. The black and white for me is also reflective of the ideologies of the day.... as most folks on both sides of the issue viewed things in black and white terms only. My initial score is an 8, but I will most certainly re-visit the one again.\ Great job.', '2005-02-23 23:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
