(1192334, 149343, 34041, '<td valign="top">the background, especially the fold up the middle and the extra peice ont he rigt, really distract from this image. Tighter cropping on the right might have helped. Also - I can see you in the refelction...</td>', 'the background, especially the fold up the middle and the extra peice ont he rigt, really distract from this image. Tighter cropping on the right might have helped. Also - I can see you in the refelction...', '2005-02-24 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
