(1192974, 149428, 33473, '<td valign="top">Not the greatest shot I''ve seen, but a fascinating, seemingly universal concept. Often the though historical events can be memorable, often the personal events are what leave the biggest impact.</td>', 'Not the greatest shot I''ve seen, but a fascinating, seemingly universal concept. Often the though historical events can be memorable, often the personal events are what leave the biggest impact.', '2005-02-24 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
