(1193113, 149571, 14773, '<td valign="top">Looks like a direct flash.  The record player is definetly 70''s but the lighting is killing it...</td>', 'Looks like a direct flash.  The record player is definetly 70''s but the lighting is killing it...', '2005-02-24 17:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193120, 149376, 14773, '<td valign="top">This has potential to be a good shot: nice model, nice location, plenty of light.  But the composition just kills it. As far as I know neon and jean is an 80''s thing, not 70''s. But that aside, her pose only detracts from the shot instead of accentuating the architecture. 4.</td>', 'This has potential to be a good shot: nice model, nice location, plenty of light.  But the composition just kills it. As far as I know neon and jean is an 80''s thing, not 70''s. But that aside, her pose only detracts from the shot instead of accentuating the architecture. 4.', '2005-02-24 17:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193122, 149457, 14773, '<td valign="top">LOL sweet idea.  The whole image is flat/grey though. Boosting the contrast/levels/curves would revive this shot. 6</td>', 'LOL sweet idea.  The whole image is flat/grey though. Boosting the contrast/levels/curves would revive this shot. 6', '2005-02-24 17:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193125, 149213, 33726, '<td valign="top">i''d like to see some lighting work to brighten up the 8-track tape.</td>', 'i''d like to see some lighting work to brighten up the 8-track tape.', '2005-02-24 17:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193126, 148124, 14773, '<td valign="top">Decent shot but it doesn''t tingle my spidey senses.</td>', 'Decent shot but it doesn''t tingle my spidey senses.', '2005-02-24 17:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193129, 148748, 14773, '<td valign="top">It''s a cool idea and she looks natural, but the whole image is flat.  You''ve got good lighting - just needs to be stronger or at least have more contrast. 6</td>', 'It''s a cool idea and she looks natural, but the whole image is flat.  You''ve got good lighting - just needs to be stronger or at least have more contrast. 6', '2005-02-24 17:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193130, 149545, 14773, '<td valign="top">LOL I had to read the title about 10 times before I got (I can be slow at times, yes).  I dig it. 6</td>', 'LOL I had to read the title about 10 times before I got (I can be slow at times, yes).  I dig it. 6', '2005-02-24 17:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193134, 149230, 14773, '<td valign="top">This shot would benefit greatly from better lighting.  Cute kid and cute setup/pose.  Seems a bit flat, though (the off white background with the wrinkles doesn''t really fit).</td>', 'This shot would benefit greatly from better lighting.  Cute kid and cute setup/pose.  Seems a bit flat, though (the off white background with the wrinkles doesn''t really fit).', '2005-02-24 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193139, 149458, 14773, '<td valign="top">This is cool, I like it. Out of focus, but that''s apart of why I like it. Great use of color too.7</td>', 'This is cool, I like it. Out of focus, but that''s apart of why I like it. Great use of color too.7', '2005-02-24 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193142, 149564, 14773, '<td valign="top">The idea of war and bomb shelters was intense in the 70''s (so I hear/read) and this shot, albeit, conveys a point, but doesn''t evoke any emotion.  I think you could''ve taken the idea and ran with it in a much more dramatic and effective way.</td>', 'The idea of war and bomb shelters was intense in the 70''s (so I hear/read) and this shot, albeit, conveys a point, but doesn''t evoke any emotion.  I think you could''ve taken the idea and ran with it in a much more dramatic and effective way.', '2005-02-24 17:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193144, 149517, 14773, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot. Love the grain, very retro..maybe more 50''s than 70''s with the black and white..but whatever, good work (it''s a bit tilted though).7</td>', 'This is a good shot. Love the grain, very retro..maybe more 50''s than 70''s with the black and white..but whatever, good work (it''s a bit tilted though).7', '2005-02-24 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
