(1193151, 149552, 14773, '<td valign="top">Could be cool...the lighting is very flat, though and uninteresting.  Love the headphones! lol</td>', 'Could be cool...the lighting is very flat, though and uninteresting.  Love the headphones! lol', '2005-02-24 17:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
