(1193960, 149613, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very Interesting Image...one I enjoy studying.  Don''t want to miss a thing.  There''s so much going on  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very Interesting Image...one I enjoy studying.  Don''t want to miss a thing.  There''s so much going on  <7>', '2005-02-25 07:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
