(1193963, 149600, 30018, '<td valign="top">I remember having one of those!  Green with racing stripes, actually!  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I remember having one of those!  Green with racing stripes, actually!  <6>', '2005-02-25 07:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193966, 148244, 30018, '<td valign="top">Oh My God, has it been that long ...?  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Oh My God, has it been that long ...?  <6>', '2005-02-25 07:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193971, 149503, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but not the greatest of quality photos.  The high contrast on the white car and the man''s hands pulls my eyes away from the main subjects.  Also, it seems like the light on her face is coming from a different direction then the light in the rest of the photo.  But I still love the composition &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Interesting idea, but not the greatest of quality photos.  The high contrast on the white car and the man''s hands pulls my eyes away from the main subjects.  Also, it seems like the light on her face is coming from a different direction then the light in the rest of the photo.  But I still love the composition <6>', '2005-02-25 07:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193977, 149395, 30018, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Love the lighting. <7>', '2005-02-25 07:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193980, 149516, 30018, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I think this would have been much better on a black background.  But that''s just me.  Nice detail, and lighting.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'For some reason, I think this would have been much better on a black background.  But that''s just me.  Nice detail, and lighting.  <7>', '2005-02-25 07:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193982, 149173, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo...brings back memories of the 70''s.  Nice textures, and interesting lighting.  Too bad you lost the detail in the button.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very nice photo...brings back memories of the 70''s.  Nice textures, and interesting lighting.  Too bad you lost the detail in the button.  <7>', '2005-02-25 07:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193988, 148587, 8610, '<td valign="top">Bobby Fisher never played versus Karpov, He played versus Boris Spasky in Reykjavík 1972. That was the real Cold War in chess. Bobby Fisher stoped playing Chess after that mast(besides a rematch in old Yugoslavia 1992)<br/> <br/>About this picture. Nice use of dof, Thie kings are sharp. But a bit noisy in the background - 6</td>', 'Bobby Fisher never played versus Karpov, He played versus Boris Spasky in Reykjavík 1972. That was the real Cold War in chess. Bobby Fisher stoped playing Chess after that mast(besides a rematch in old Yugoslavia 1992) About this picture. Nice use of dof, Thie kings are sharp. But a bit noisy in the background - 6', '2005-02-25 07:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193989, 148244, 8610, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-02-25 07:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193992, 149344, 30018, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite picture in the Challege.  It may be because the model in this picture looks so much like John Lennon, and the title fits so nicely.  Great compostion, with interesting colors throughout the image.  Nicely done &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'I think this is my favorite picture in the Challege.  It may be because the model in this picture looks so much like John Lennon, and the title fits so nicely.  Great compostion, with interesting colors throughout the image.  Nicely done <9>', '2005-02-25 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1193995, 149386, 30018, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I began my photography in 1973, so these old guys bring back some learning memories.  Nice photo with interesting DOF.  Nicely Done &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I love this image.  I began my photography in 1973, so these old guys bring back some learning memories.  Nice photo with interesting DOF.  Nicely Done <8>', '2005-02-25 07:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194001, 149268, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting effect.  I love the beautiful model in front of the old heat register.&lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Very nice lighting effect.  I love the beautiful model in front of the old heat register.<9>', '2005-02-25 07:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194002, 148748, 30018, '<td valign="top">Pretty eyes that match her top.  Nice pose.  Love the hair.  Not crazy about the white background, but that''s just me.  This picture could apply today in the 21 century, just as easily as it did in the 70''s.  History...its a funny thing.  It always wants to repeat itself.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Pretty eyes that match her top.  Nice pose.  Love the hair.  Not crazy about the white background, but that''s just me.  This picture could apply today in the 21 century, just as easily as it did in the 70''s.  History...its a funny thing.  It always wants to repeat itself.  <8>', '2005-02-25 07:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194017, 147859, 34233, '<td valign="top">the technique is 5, but geeeeze......, your model is very beautiful, she looks like some kinda princess from the old times, stunning exotic eyes......  She deserves a marvelous shot.</td>', 'the technique is 5, but geeeeze......, your model is very beautiful, she looks like some kinda princess from the old times, stunning exotic eyes......  She deserves a marvelous shot.', '2005-02-25 08:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
