(1194298, 149281, 14773, '<td valign="top">Great sketches but the way they''re presented here is a bit dull.  I like the partial lighting on each face, though. 6</td>', 'Great sketches but the way they''re presented here is a bit dull.  I like the partial lighting on each face, though. 6', '2005-02-25 13:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
