(1194305, 149301, 14773, '<td valign="top">Ahh I like the 70''s color desat and overal comp. I think the TV could''ve been placed on/near the road better tho. 7</td>', 'Ahh I like the 70''s color desat and overal comp. I think the TV could''ve been placed on/near the road better tho. 7', '2005-02-25 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194344, 148249, 25095, '<td valign="top">good idea and nice setup but I think the DOF could be better to hide the seams in the backdrop and although there were hippies then I think this would look better with just the hair slicked back and not showing the length.  Leisure suit wearers usually had that clean cut I''m cool look.  Still a good image though.</td>', 'good idea and nice setup but I think the DOF could be better to hide the seams in the backdrop and although there were hippies then I think this would look better with just the hair slicked back and not showing the length.  Leisure suit wearers usually had that clean cut I''m cool look.  Still a good image though.', '2005-02-25 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194348, 149596, 25095, '<td valign="top">goo subject and idea but seems a little dull on the contrast side but then again it just could be since they are so old.  Good luck</td>', 'goo subject and idea but seems a little dull on the contrast side but then again it just could be since they are so old.  Good luck', '2005-02-25 13:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194349, 149544, 25095, '<td valign="top">Probably should have asked the people to turn off the house lights...oh wait that''s the actual paint...whoa!  I can only imagine how the inside is frozen in time...I can see maybe a dial phone, yellow on kitchen wall with writing tablet next to it on a roll...lol  Good luck</td>', 'Probably should have asked the people to turn off the house lights...oh wait that''s the actual paint...whoa!  I can only imagine how the inside is frozen in time...I can see maybe a dial phone, yellow on kitchen wall with writing tablet next to it on a roll...lol  Good luck', '2005-02-25 13:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194352, 149432, 25095, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite get the 70''s reference but that doesn''t mean a lot.  I would have preferred a little more lighting on the head part...it appears he has his head turned towards the viewer but really difficlut to tell.  Hard to tell what the flying things are and since I''m not familiar with this item I can''t even guess.  nice colors and sharpness on the main item.  Good luck.</td>', 'Don''t quite get the 70''s reference but that doesn''t mean a lot.  I would have preferred a little more lighting on the head part...it appears he has his head turned towards the viewer but really difficlut to tell.  Hard to tell what the flying things are and since I''m not familiar with this item I can''t even guess.  nice colors and sharpness on the main item.  Good luck.', '2005-02-25 13:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194354, 148335, 25095, '<td valign="top">come on, fess up...that hair is real isn''t it? lol :)  Something seems wrong in the facial area but I can''t put my finger on it.  Nice offset, maybe just a tad too much flash on the peace sign.  Good luck</td>', 'come on, fess up...that hair is real isn''t it? lol :)  Something seems wrong in the facial area but I can''t put my finger on it.  Nice offset, maybe just a tad too much flash on the peace sign.  Good luck', '2005-02-25 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194360, 149600, 25095, '<td valign="top">Very 70''s but this doesn''t have much appeal to me.  The tones are a little dark and I like the noise effect but it still lacks interest for me.  I''d probably lose the cars on the right since they appear more modern.  Good luck</td>', 'Very 70''s but this doesn''t have much appeal to me.  The tones are a little dark and I like the noise effect but it still lacks interest for me.  I''d probably lose the cars on the right since they appear more modern.  Good luck', '2005-02-25 13:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194364, 148459, 25095, '<td valign="top">nice, good color, good setup and good variety of items that all relate to the 70''s and each other.  I would have preferred no flash on the left of the LP but still good work.</td>', 'nice, good color, good setup and good variety of items that all relate to the 70''s and each other.  I would have preferred no flash on the left of the LP but still good work.', '2005-02-25 13:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1194365, 149552, 25095, '<td valign="top">nice idea only thing I would like to see different is if the newspaper wasn''t so old looking (yes I know it is really that old) but she looks like she is living in the 70s with those headphones, LP and glasses but the paper looks too old.  Maybe if you set your white balance off of it it would be more white.  May hurt the other colors though...just thinking with my fingers again.  Good luck</td>', 'nice idea only thing I would like to see different is if the newspaper wasn''t so old looking (yes I know it is really that old) but she looks like she is living in the 70s with those headphones, LP and glasses but the paper looks too old.  Maybe if you set your white balance off of it it would be more white.  May hurt the other colors though...just thinking with my fingers again.  Good luck', '2005-02-25 13:57:30.000000', NULL, 1);
