(1195835, 149019, 30441, '<td valign="top">I like it but all the elements seem more of a fit to the 60''s. Well done composition and effects though.</td>', 'I like it but all the elements seem more of a fit to the 60''s. Well done composition and effects though.', '2005-02-26 14:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
