(1196354, 149050, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.  Burning bras....never really happened though.  Bras were tossed into the trash cans in the 60''s and draft cards were burned....and somehow the two events merged.  The 70''s brought us women daring not to wear the bras, but I challenge you to prove that at ANY time "burning" bras really even happened.  All that aside, great pic!</td>', 'Very cool picture.  Burning bras....never really happened though.  Bras were tossed into the trash cans in the 60''s and draft cards were burned....and somehow the two events merged.  The 70''s brought us women daring not to wear the bras, but I challenge you to prove that at ANY time "burning" bras really even happened.  All that aside, great pic!', '2005-02-27 01:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
