(1196919, 149019, 25261, '<td valign="top">Beatles broke up in 1969.<br/>Sgt. Pepper''s Lonely Hearts Club Band is an album by the British band The Beatles. It is often called one of the most influential rock albums of all time by prominent critics and publications, including Rolling Stone. It was recorded by The Beatles over a 129-day period beginning on December 6, 1966. The album was released on June 1, 1967 in the United Kingdom and on June 2, 1967 in the United States.</td>', 'Beatles broke up in 1969.Sgt. Pepper''s Lonely Hearts Club Band is an album by the British band The Beatles. It is often called one of the most influential rock albums of all time by prominent critics and publications, including Rolling Stone. It was recorded by The Beatles over a 129-day period beginning on December 6, 1966. The album was released on June 1, 1967 in the United Kingdom and on June 2, 1967 in the United States.', '2005-02-27 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1196920, 149259, 25261, '<td valign="top">My favorite</td>', 'My favorite', '2005-02-27 17:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1196924, 149512, 25261, '<td valign="top">Flower power was a slogan used by hippies in the 1960s as a symbol of the non-violence ideology. The term is said to have been coined by the US poet Allen Ginsberg in 1965. It has since been used in many places when referring the sixties, including countless films, TV programs and documentaries</td>', 'Flower power was a slogan used by hippies in the 1960s as a symbol of the non-violence ideology. The term is said to have been coined by the US poet Allen Ginsberg in 1965. It has since been used in many places when referring the sixties, including countless films, TV programs and documentaries', '2005-02-27 17:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1196934, 148888, 25261, '<td valign="top">late 60''s Camaro SS = 70''s?</td>', 'late 60''s Camaro SS = 70''s?', '2005-02-27 17:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1196935, 149516, 25261, '<td valign="top">This really says 1970''s to me. I like the minimalist backdrop and set. I wish the model had a pair of platform shoes!</td>', 'This really says 1970''s to me. I like the minimalist backdrop and set. I wish the model had a pair of platform shoes!', '2005-02-27 17:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1196939, 149301, 25261, '<td valign="top">My wife and I laughed out loud when we saw this old console TV. Man everybody and their friends family had one like this!</td>', 'My wife and I laughed out loud when we saw this old console TV. Man everybody and their friends family had one like this!', '2005-02-27 17:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1196942, 148685, 25261, '<td valign="top">English racers was the name we gave these when we first started seeing them in the 70''s</td>', 'English racers was the name we gave these when we first started seeing them in the 70''s', '2005-02-27 17:56:13.000000', NULL, 1);
