(1197065, 149600, 32338, '<td valign="top">This would be even better if it was cropped to the same ''square'' dimensions in which snapshot photos were developed during the ''70''s.</td>', 'This would be even better if it was cropped to the same ''square'' dimensions in which snapshot photos were developed during the ''70''s.', '2005-02-27 20:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
