(1197209, 149173, 34307, '<td valign="top">Initially I rated this photo quite favorably, but over the past  twenty-four hours, I''ve come back to it time and time again.  In the end, considering the "ruling" imagery, the excellent composition and the exacting b&amp;w tones, I upgraded it to a ten.  Wish I could have made it a ten plus.</td>', 'Initially I rated this photo quite favorably, but over the past  twenty-four hours, I''ve come back to it time and time again.  In the end, considering the "ruling" imagery, the excellent composition and the exacting b&w tones, I upgraded it to a ten.  Wish I could have made it a ten plus.', '2005-02-27 22:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197213, 149516, 34307, '<td valign="top">The boots, the bell bottoms, the fabrics/colors and the attitude are all exquisitely 70''s.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The boots, the bell bottoms, the fabrics/colors and the attitude are all exquisitely 70''s.  Nicely done.', '2005-02-27 22:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
