(1197215, 149186, 34307, '<td valign="top">Perhaps oversharpened but the composition is eye-grabbing and, consequently, earned a favorable rating from me. Did I miss something?  How does this relate to the 70''s?</td>', 'Perhaps oversharpened but the composition is eye-grabbing and, consequently, earned a favorable rating from me. Did I miss something?  How does this relate to the 70''s?', '2005-02-27 22:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
