(1198705, 149385, 30841, '<td valign="top">??Sorry, but this is too suspect because of the other photo that has yearbooks with the same title (see "the leaves of time")?? I may be wrong but it leads me to believe that someone is submitting 2x under different names?? Too bad because I originally rated as a 7, but now a 2. If it is just a coincidence I apologize, but that is just my feeling.</td>', '??Sorry, but this is too suspect because of the other photo that has yearbooks with the same title (see "the leaves of time")?? I may be wrong but it leads me to believe that someone is submitting 2x under different names?? Too bad because I originally rated as a 7, but now a 2. If it is just a coincidence I apologize, but that is just my feeling.', '2005-02-28 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
