(1200753, 148906, 27108, '<td valign="top">Lovely collection, Im a 79 model... but I have them too, both in LP and CD! :D<br/>The Lp´s were from my father.. he buyed it and only played it once, and recorded it to a cassette! :P   So he wouldnt use the LP anymore, to not scratch them! :)<br/> <br/>I have over 20 thousand LP´s, but they are stored at my familys houses, cause I dont have enough space!!   but one day!!! :D<br/> <br/>anyways.... I also see they are in a Guitar Case, sweet. :)  (Im a guitarist) ;)<br/> <br/>photographically speaking... not so special... but would be much better if you maked a white frame on it!<br/> <br/>give you a 5, cause the music (should be a 10 for them though)... but then again.. this is a photo contest! :)</td>', 'Lovely collection, Im a 79 model... but I have them too, both in LP and CD! :DThe Lp´s were from my father.. he buyed it and only played it once, and recorded it to a cassette! :P   So he wouldnt use the LP anymore, to not scratch them! :) I have over 20 thousand LP´s, but they are stored at my familys houses, cause I dont have enough space!!   but one day!!! :D anyways.... I also see they are in a Guitar Case, sweet. :)  (Im a guitarist) ;) photographically speaking... not so special... but would be much better if you maked a white frame on it! give you a 5, cause the music (should be a 10 for them though)... but then again.. this is a photo contest! :)', '2005-03-01 09:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
