(1202146, 149545, 17507, '<td valign="top">Wow, way underrated. Just goes to show you how little appreciation there is for anything not tack-sharp. I definitely understood this image, but I guess those that said they wanted it in focus didn''t... oh well! <i>De gustibus non disputandum</i>, and this is still a good picture.</td>', 'Wow, way underrated. Just goes to show you how little appreciation there is for anything not tack-sharp. I definitely understood this image, but I guess those that said they wanted it in focus didn''t... oh well! De gustibus non disputandum, and this is still a good picture.', '2005-03-02 00:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
