(1202158, 149268, 18367, '<td valign="top">I see no reference whatsover to the 70''s in this photo.  The jeans, replete with holes were more an 80''s thing,,, <br/> <br/>Having had the good fortune of enjoying the 70''s, the title utilized in this instance is not in keeping with the "Free Spirits" I had the pleasure to encounter during that time frame.<br/> <br/>Not a bad photo, but from my perspective, did not meet the challenge.<br/> <br/>Ray<br/> <br/></td>', 'I see no reference whatsover to the 70''s in this photo.  The jeans, replete with holes were more an 80''s thing,,,  Having had the good fortune of enjoying the 70''s, the title utilized in this instance is not in keeping with the "Free Spirits" I had the pleasure to encounter during that time frame. Not a bad photo, but from my perspective, did not meet the challenge. Ray ', '2005-03-02 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
