(1202593, 149173, 31637, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your yellow ribbon, I voted this a 6 and thought it was a very clear, crisp photo. The topic is very seventies and the hard work you put in has paid off...I really enjoyed looking through your profile ! Keep it up !</td>', 'Congrats on your yellow ribbon, I voted this a 6 and thought it was a very clear, crisp photo. The topic is very seventies and the hard work you put in has paid off...I really enjoyed looking through your profile ! Keep it up !', '2005-03-02 03:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1202626, 149019, 30364, '<td valign="top">Mike,  <br/>This is terrific.  I see some commentators reminded you that "Lucy" and "Sgt Pepper" were actually 60''s.  Nonsense!  Those of us who were there don''t actually remember the 60''s at all; we remember 1958 or ''59, and then nothing much until the early 70''s.  So Sgt Pepper seems very 70''s to us.  Ergo you were right.  Plus your photo is VERY 1970''s.  Congratulations on a good result.</td>', 'Mike,  This is terrific.  I see some commentators reminded you that "Lucy" and "Sgt Pepper" were actually 60''s.  Nonsense!  Those of us who were there don''t actually remember the 60''s at all; we remember 1958 or ''59, and then nothing much until the early 70''s.  So Sgt Pepper seems very 70''s to us.  Ergo you were right.  Plus your photo is VERY 1970''s.  Congratulations on a good result.', '2005-03-02 04:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1202637, 149500, 17033, '<td valign="top">That''s it. I''ve had it with these voters....I''ll boycott the update button for 1 hour in remembrance of this picture. Keep up the good work and you will be rewarded in time! Ben.</td>', 'That''s it. I''ve had it with these voters....I''ll boycott the update button for 1 hour in remembrance of this picture. Keep up the good work and you will be rewarded in time! Ben.', '2005-03-02 04:25:54.000000', NULL, 0);
