(1202823, 149507, 29256, '<td valign="top">If you look there are 7 D''s: Dollar, Dart, Dog, Die, Diamond, Duracell and Dime. I wanted to stray from the traditional shots that most folks submitted, album covers, photo''s, yearbooks etc. I figured I would get hammered straying with a play on the subject but wanted to just have fun. Thanks for all the comments and votes!</td>', 'If you look there are 7 D''s: Dollar, Dart, Dog, Die, Diamond, Duracell and Dime. I wanted to stray from the traditional shots that most folks submitted, album covers, photo''s, yearbooks etc. I figured I would get hammered straying with a play on the subject but wanted to just have fun. Thanks for all the comments and votes!', '2005-03-02 08:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
