(1202930, 149500, 31240, '<td valign="top">I agree with bpickard.  This picture should have scored higher.  Great shot and 70''s feel.  Skateboards were a 70''s thing with the banana boards.  I don''t know how someone would not remember that.  I gave you a 10.<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-02 09:28:44.</i></td>', 'I agree with bpickard.  This picture should have scored higher.  Great shot and 70''s feel.  Skateboards were a 70''s thing with the banana boards.  I don''t know how someone would not remember that.  I gave you a 10. ', '2005-03-02 09:21:35.000000', '2005-03-02 09:28:44.000000', 0),
(1202935, 149500, 2741, '<td valign="top">Hey... i gave this a 7, and I have to admit... I thought this would do well. This deserves more than a 5.5 avg. As far as some people saying that this is not 70''s... you need a history lesson, because thats when it erupted. And that board he is using is definitely not 80''s. Thats a 70''s style board and design, and had no place in the 80''s and 90''s. I was a sponsored skater in the 80''s to mid 90''s and I was not riding those, so I would know.<br/> <br/>As far as the 1980''s are concerned, the 80''s was more of the evolution period in shape and design. <b>But skateboarding is definitely a 1970''s icon.</b><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-04 08:22:26.</i></td>', 'Hey... i gave this a 7, and I have to admit... I thought this would do well. This deserves more than a 5.5 avg. As far as some people saying that this is not 70''s... you need a history lesson, because thats when it erupted. And that board he is using is definitely not 80''s. Thats a 70''s style board and design, and had no place in the 80''s and 90''s. I was a sponsored skater in the 80''s to mid 90''s and I was not riding those, so I would know. As far as the 1980''s are concerned, the 80''s was more of the evolution period in shape and design. But skateboarding is definitely a 1970''s icon.', '2005-03-02 09:26:16.000000', '2005-03-04 08:22:26.000000', 0),
