(1203300, 149492, 32932, '<td valign="top">Yeps, it was invented in 1974 which makes it something out of the seventies, but yes it wasn´t very popular until 1980. <br/>The object in the top left corner is my finger pressing the camera button and yes I agree it is distracting and I also agree about the cylinder I should have skipped it.<br/> <br/>I took about 40 photos of various setups and was as always in the last minutes and this was I think the best picture og the batch</td>', 'Yeps, it was invented in 1974 which makes it something out of the seventies, but yes it wasn´t very popular until 1980. The object in the top left corner is my finger pressing the camera button and yes I agree it is distracting and I also agree about the cylinder I should have skipped it. I took about 40 photos of various setups and was as always in the last minutes and this was I think the best picture og the batch', '2005-03-02 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
