(1204979, 149553, 28930, '<td valign="top">&lt;sarcasm&gt;<br/>wow, i don''t get it, I just see drops<br/>&lt;/sarcasm&gt;<br/> <br/>isn''t the peace sign from the 60''s, and the rainbow from the gay revloution?<br/> <br/>not even on-topic or original, but it wins first place???<br/> <br/>Its not that I don''t respect your work (its not a _bad_ shot), its just that I don''t understand the voters.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-03 04:29:48.</i></td>', '<sarcasm>wow, i don''t get it, I just see drops</sarcasm> isn''t the peace sign from the 60''s, and the rainbow from the gay revloution? not even on-topic or original, but it wins first place??? Its not that I don''t respect your work (its not a _bad_ shot), its just that I don''t understand the voters.', '2005-03-03 03:58:03.000000', '2005-03-03 04:29:48.000000', 0),
