(1205411, 149553, 19425, '<td valign="top">great job...im happy to see it win...<br/> <br/>im so tired of people saying that "its been done before" or so and so already did it...thats just silly....<br/> <br/>NO one says that about sunsets, waterfalls, birds, and portraits...<br/> <br/>whats the difference?? everyone should actually go try to do this shot...its not as easy as it seems..<br/> <br/>AGain, great shot....</td>', 'great job...im happy to see it win... im so tired of people saying that "its been done before" or so and so already did it...thats just silly.... NO one says that about sunsets, waterfalls, birds, and portraits... whats the difference?? everyone should actually go try to do this shot...its not as easy as it seems.. AGain, great shot....', '2005-03-03 12:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1205444, 149395, 33435, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by zamboni:</b></div><hr/><i> I am surprised you got a 10 for this shot.... it''s too dark. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey, what can I say?  Personally, I like the shot.  I agree that its dark, and I''d be happier if I could have had more time to work on it.  Here is the deal.  The synth was made in 1981, and I didn''t want some nit picky, anal retentive DP user to get all up in arms over the synth used in the shot.  The concept of analog synthesizer is very 70''s, and I thought I submitted a good idea, regardless of the make and model of the synth used.  That is why its dark, so people don''t see that its a Korg Trident.  And, by the way, to the people that did vote a 10, I appreciate your kindness, and thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by zamboni: I am surprised you got a 10 for this shot.... it''s too dark.   Hey, what can I say?  Personally, I like the shot.  I agree that its dark, and I''d be happier if I could have had more time to work on it.  Here is the deal.  The synth was made in 1981, and I didn''t want some nit picky, anal retentive DP user to get all up in arms over the synth used in the shot.  The concept of analog synthesizer is very 70''s, and I thought I submitted a good idea, regardless of the make and model of the synth used.  That is why its dark, so people don''t see that its a Korg Trident.  And, by the way, to the people that did vote a 10, I appreciate your kindness, and thank you.', '2005-03-03 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1205573, 149313, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great artistic take on the challenge.  Beautiful image, even outside of a challenge.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great artistic take on the challenge.  Beautiful image, even outside of a challenge.  Nice work.', '2005-03-03 13:04:23.000000', NULL, 0),
