(1207153, 148423, 33884, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SteveHamon:</b></div><hr/><i> careful with glare on the album cover. it looks a bit washed out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Maybe I made a mistake choosing this album. The design of the cover is exactly that - washed out. One of the reasons I chose it. Oh well!<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by SteveHamon: careful with glare on the album cover. it looks a bit washed out.  Maybe I made a mistake choosing this album. The design of the cover is exactly that - washed out. One of the reasons I chose it. Oh well!', '2005-03-04 05:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
