(1219826, 149173, 16420, '<td valign="top">I can understand your photo getting a 6 or even a 5 - DPC voters are tough! I am willing to bet, however, that the person who gave you a 1 either didn''t actually look at your photo, looked at your photo but doesn''t vote based upon a photo''s merit, or worse, let their personal/political agenda vote. Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I can understand your photo getting a 6 or even a 5 - DPC voters are tough! I am willing to bet, however, that the person who gave you a 1 either didn''t actually look at your photo, looked at your photo but doesn''t vote based upon a photo''s merit, or worse, let their personal/political agenda vote. Congrats on the ribbon!', '2005-03-10 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
